---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>I build devices that have to keep working when nobody is watching.</h1>
  <p>Control panels in greenhouses, sensor nodes in water tanks, scanners in doorways — and, in my day job, the SIM and eSIM products that connect things like them to a network.</p>
  <p class="now">These are write-ups of what I built, what it cost, and what I got wrong.</p>
  <div class="readout">
    <div>Now<b>Senior QA Engineer, IDEMIA</b></div>
    <div>Builds<b>ESP32 · FreeRTOS · MQTT · BLE</b></div>
    <div>Validates<b>UICC / eUICC · GSMA RSP</b></div>
    <div>Based in<b>{{ site.location }}</b></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="index-head">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <span>{{ collections.projects.length }} write-ups</span>
</div>
<ul class="project-list">
{% for p in collections.projects %}
  <li>
    <a class="project-row" href="{{ p.url | url }}">
      <div>
        <h3 class="project-title">{{ p.data.title }}</h3>
        <p class="project-sub">{{ p.data.resultShort }}</p>
        <div class="project-meta">
          <span>{{ p.data.year }}</span>
          <span>{{ p.data.role }}</span>
          <span>{{ p.data.stack | join(" · ") }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 220 48" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <line class="axis" x1="0" y1="47" x2="220" y2="47"/>
        <path d="{{ traces[p.data.trace] }}"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
